      "MIRIAM: Yeah.\nLIZ: Me too. I used to live in the city and spent my lunch break at the modern like every day.",
      "JEN/MIRIAM/LIZ: Oh totally/yeah/right?\nMIRIAM: I used to be a stripper. If you can believe that.\nMIRIAM: Just for a little while. But I just couldn’t feel further from that life now.\nJEN: The before times, right?",
      "MIRIAM: And your sweater is cool too.\nJEN: You should join us for our Friday morning hike!",
      "MIRIAM: You’re so funny.\nLIZ: I can’t hike very far these days.\nJEN: Yeah, how are you feeling? Can I?",
